Intended path LICENSE -> cfg mode. PERIOD-FORM of the principal copyright line:
the sentence-final period after the PRINCIPAL's name. Before c2 (Arc 69 / stoa--y12)
the cpat captured "Denson Smith." WITH the trailing period, and is_principal -- which
does not strip trailing punctuation -- false-BLOCKED the PRINCIPAL's OWN copyright
line. The c2 trailing-terminal-punctuation strip yields "Denson Smith" -> is_principal
ALLOWs. This is the both-directions PRINCIPAL half of the c2 fixture pair.
